  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": "Dissolve KH2PO4, K2HPO4, NH4Cl and Na2S2O3・5H2O in 500 ml distilled water. Separately dissolve CaCl2・2H2O, MgCl2・6H2O and Trace metal solutionin 460 ml distilled water. Autoclave both solutions, mix them after cooling, and add 40 ml filter-sterilized 5% NaHCO3 solution to the medium. Adjust pH to 7.0 with HCl, if necessary."
    },
    {
